// Relation (~func) mappings: relation class mappings over the seeded tables -- ~src, a filter, a group-by and
// a window in the source relation, expression right-hand sides, a primary key, a local property, embedded and
// inline embedded, unions, a binding transformer, a ModelJoin and an XStore association (8116-relmap.pure). Each
// relation-mapped service (RM_) mirrors a twin (RMR_) over the same classes mapped relationally over the same
// tables; the twin's expectation comes from the reference evaluator -- see scripts/corpus/relmap.py.
//
// GENERATED by scripts/corpus/build.py -- do not edit by hand.

###Service
Service stress::RMR_Deals
{
    pattern: '/stress/relmap/twin/deals';
